---
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Demo Lab</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;600;700&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" />
  </head>
  <body>

    <header class="top">
      <span class="wordmark">DEMO&nbsp;LAB</span>
      <a class="cta" href="#contact">Discuss a pilot</a>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <p class="kicker">ADVANCED ANALYTICS · END TO END · PUBLIC DATA</p>
      <h1>We turn open data into instruments.</h1>
      <p class="sub">Satellites, trade ledgers, statistical registries — acquired,
      engineered, modeled, and delivered as living dashboards. Every case below is
      real, reproducible, and validated in the open. Play with them.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cases">

      <a class="case live" data-case="nightlights" href={DEMOS.nightlights} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src="/tile-nightlights.jpg" alt="Java and Sumatra at night from orbit, amber city lights" loading="lazy" />
        <div class="case-body">
          <span class="badge">LIVE DEMO</span>
          <h2>Nighttime-Lights Economic Pulse</h2>
          <p>Monthly satellite radiance across 514 regencies — a pulse of Indonesia’s
          economy, months ahead of official statistics. NASA Black Marble, refreshed
          on a schedule, honest about its limits.</p>
          <span class="meta">SATELLITE · ECONOMETRICS · MONTHLY CRON</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="case live" data-case="trade" href={DEMOS.trade} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src="/tile-trade.jpg" alt="The 3-D product space — every traded product as a node, Indonesia's strengths glowing copper" loading="lazy" />
        <div class="case-body">
          <span class="badge">LIVE DEMO</span>
          <h2>Indonesia in the Global Trade Network</h2>
          <p>330 million rows of bilateral trade distilled into the product space —
          and the nickel-downstreaming paradox, computed independently and checked
          against Harvard’s Atlas: processed exports grew fifteenfold while
          Indonesia’s complexity rank stood still and its neighbors climbed.</p>
          <span class="meta">330M ROWS · NETWORK SCIENCE · BACI · VALIDATED VS ATLAS</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <div class="case live" data-case="knowledge">
        <div class="case-visual pustaka-live">
          <div class="try-chips" id="try-chips"></div>
          <div class="try-answer" id="try-answer" hidden></div>
          <div class="try-sources stamp dim" id="try-sources"></div>
          <form id="try-form">
            <input id="try-q" type="text" autocomplete="off"
                   placeholder="Coba tanya di sini — try it right here…" />
            <button type="submit">Ask</button>
          </form>
          <span class="stamp dim" id="try-status">LIVE — ANSWERS FROM REAL DOCUMENTS, CITED &amp; VERIFIED</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-body">
          <span class="badge">PLATFORM · LIVE — TRY IT HERE</span>
          <h2>Pustaka — Knowledge Assistant</h2>
          <p>Upload your organization’s documents; ask in Bahasa Indonesia or
          English; every answer cites the exact pasal, page, and verbatim quote —
          verified against the source, never invented. Runs on your
          infrastructure; only the final question leaves it.</p>
          <a class="cta" href={DEMOS.knowledge} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the full demo →</a>
          <span class="meta">RAG · VERIFIED CITATIONS · LOCAL EMBEDDINGS · UU PDP–AWARE</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a class="case live" data-case="sinking" href={DEMOS.jakarta} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="case-visual sinking-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- Jakarta skyline (Monas at centre) with the waterline rising over it -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 240" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMax meet">
            <g fill="#12253C">
              <rect x="14"  y="120" width="34" height="120"/>
